Why This Matters
DNS integration with IdM is critical for enterprise environments because:

Service Discovery: SRV records enable automatic discovery of IdM services
Security: Proper DNS configuration prevents spoofing and ensures secure communications
Performance: Well-configured DNS reduces authentication latency and improves user experience
Scalability: Proper DNS setup supports large-scale IdM deployments across multiple sites
Troubleshooting: Understanding DNS integration helps quickly resolve authentication and connectivity issues
